{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c85545390dd7ce8691ff59bdb51f9f8c548b3eba0ed6033948a1727cfba5ef1", "ja": "（イベントの打ち合わせの後、桜が綺麗なので、\n瑞希と公園の中を通って帰る事にした）", "zh": "（活动会议结束后，樱花正漂亮，于是决定和瑞希一起穿过公园回去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "954e16d4f5fa58465df3bddd40d2a1a740fd2639ccc65a5690b55b4b4dcea9d7", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまでした。\n……パレード、楽しみですね。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n……游行，真让人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "22d4c82d1df92c9f5b035933aaf47a116088a028ad7c511a1e155fcc9ad9a27f", "ja": "瑞希こそ、お疲れさま。パレードも楽しみだけど、\nこの前みんなでお花見したんだって？", "zh": "瑞希才是，辛苦了。虽然我也很期待游行，\n听说你们前阵子一起赏花了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "7fbd7a63d7f1ebb29d9036bb66bf95001d3f0f91880c697577ffbc193001f736", "ja": "はい。みんなで、お花見女子会をしました。\nとても楽しかったです。", "zh": "是的。大家一起举办了赏花女子会。\n非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "6299d1d1e2167ebf4f3932b53aa1403acec6eae5e1025c356decfb6e007396f8", "ja": "天海さんや篠宮さん、佐竹さんが、たくさん\n料理やお菓子を作ってきてくれて……幸せ。", "zh": "天海小姐、篠宫小姐还有佐竹小姐，做了很多\n饭菜和点心带来……好幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1005_p", "source_sha256": "84ee6e6814789ddfdfc24a67325df160cf3191159536bd4e87a5c1e0e6764a22", "ja": "はは、そうか。あの3人が腕を振るったんじゃ、\nみんな花より団子になっちゃうよな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。那3人一展身手，大家就都会变得只顾吃美食、不顾赏花了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e47b1176945cbc49c5c02f0f81adac6f4da17fe927ca0dd3f6d5380c7a0a20bc", "ja": "なので、余興が思っていたより大変でしたが……\n無事楽しんでもらえたようです。", "zh": "所以，余兴比想象中还要辛苦，不过……\n看来大家都平安无事地玩得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3e164e4c635fd1811b324d1b1eff065c544a06efa058750717d06c84ffb08b87", "ja": "そういえば、瑞希と千早で二人羽織をやったんだって？\nけど、どうして二人羽織を……？", "zh": "说起来，听说瑞希和千早一起表演了二人羽织？\n不过，为什么要表演二人羽织……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5f595de77d11e49b23259ace9a00939bdc0897f518e32abdab4e556bba67586", "ja": "はい。お弁当は、佐竹さんたちが\n担当してくれることになったので……。", "zh": "是的。便当已经由佐竹小姐她们负责了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "5da3f638f499feaa4d7b89a8f0a44ce8d8c59846b875061da7952e3e05f9f575", "ja": "私たちは、調理を担当してくれたメンバーを労い、\n何か、楽しませることをしてみようかと。", "zh": "我们想着，慰劳一下负责烹饪的成员，做些什么让大家开心一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3f63e2882975c9f0b9e680c8030b3d15bdf34640d7136c420bf570f9a1ed80eb", "ja": "なるほど、それで余興をする事になったのか。\nみんな、喜んだんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此，所以才决定表演余兴节目啊。大家都很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "35bf7a820aa586fc60f56917ce047d0824147850417a70ce27f0fcd7cb054866", "ja": "はい。私は、如月さんとスケジュールを合わせて、\n空き時間に練習をしたのですが……。", "zh": "是的。我和如月小姐协调了日程，在空闲时间进行了练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "ddfe0fe9ffab56baac10943f2837de87b49065879d71283fd8aa48a301c202f4", "ja": "本番では、みんな、とても笑ってくれました。\n……大成功だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "正式表演时，大家都笑得特别开心。\n……大成功了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe807cdbb755921792c90e8349d0019a7c9a637a4729ec3bdb364236e46e5679", "ja": "けど、笑顔だったのはかくし芸だけではありません。\nお弁当を食べる間も、みんな、ずっと笑っていました。", "zh": "不过，大家露出笑容的可不只是表演才艺的时候。\n就连吃便当时，大家也一直笑个不停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ce41ba8fbb6b9200d73f27edac7641ce42faa988a523cd507b599e1650753e2c", "ja": "うん、そうか。\n瑞希やみんなが楽しかったなら、何よりだよ。", "zh": "嗯，这样啊。\n瑞希和大家玩得开心，那就是最重要的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "42db04c8685a165bcef9934341dcfd443421f6b65e7b8a4ee0f4dc31842f79da", "ja": "けど私には、ひとつだけ心残りなことがあります。", "zh": "不过对我来说，还有一件让人遗憾的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7cb7615339a9d33883f14ee41dea1428ef39aeacd67d20be2280d628ea421ef3", "ja": "心残り？", "zh": "遗憾？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "175ff7b85fc4ecdc47f8bf0f952c99aeb06b3076e2004636beb730e63e59d355", "ja": "如月さんとの二人羽織、\n{$P$}にも見せたかったぞ。", "zh": "和如月小姐一起表演的二人羽织，\n真想也让{$P$}看看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c82a478fd665548ba76e6bd37026bd3c1a9f649cca79dfe1b3d49e0f2ddb6d6a", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nなら来年は、見せてもらう事にするよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？那明年就让我也看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "54483c8a36ba5cc5b7040b4dda4fb5d365c294c124aa798f44d16bdd27a2aa5f", "ja": "来年……そうですね。では来年も、\n私のかくし芸は、二人羽織にしようと思います。", "zh": "明年……是啊。那么明年也请让我表演二人羽织吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0183_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "5d046570dd2fb29428734068d1576f6f6b10ed3e87f4bbca5672096a2bb0ff03", "ja": "{$P$}。来年のお花見を、\n楽しみにしていてください。……予約だぞ。", "zh": "{$P$}。请期待明年的赏花吧。……这是预约哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
